{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 24,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not thou envious against evil men, neither desire to be with them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For their heart studieth destruction, and their lips talk of mischief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Through wisdom is a house built; and by understanding it is established:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And by knowledge shall the chambers be filled with all precious and pleasant riches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A wise man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strong; and a man of knowledge increaseth strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For by wise counsel thou shalt make thy war: and in multitude of counselors ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " safety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " too high for a fool: he openeth not his mouth in the gate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that deviseth to do evil shall be called a mischievous person.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The thought of foolishness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sin: and the scorner ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thou faintest in the day of adversity, thy strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " small.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou forbearest to deliver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " drawn to death, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "those that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ready to be slain;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thou sayest, Behold, we knew it not; doth not he that pondereth the heart consider ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "? and he that keepeth thy soul, doth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he know ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "? and will ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he render to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " man according to his works?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, eat thou honey, because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good; and the honey-comb, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sweet to thy taste:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the knowledge of wisdom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to thy soul: when thou hast found ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", then there shall be a reward, and thy expectation shall not be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lay not wait, O wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", against the dwelling of the righteous; destroy not his resting-place:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For a just ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " falleth seven times, and riseth again: but the wicked shall fall into mischief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rejoice not when thy enemy falleth, and let not thy heart be glad when he stumbleth:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lest the LORD see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and it displease him, and he turn away his wrath from him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fret not thyself because of evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", neither be thou envious at the wicked;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For there shall be no reward to the evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "; the candle of the wicked shall be extinguished.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, fear thou the LORD and the king: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " meddle not with them that are given to change:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For their calamity shall rise suddenly; and who knoweth the ruin of them both?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belong",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the wise. ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not good to have respect of persons in judgment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that saith to the wicked, Thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " righteous; him shall the people curse, nations shall abhor him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But to them that rebuke ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be delight, and a good blessing shall come upon them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall kiss ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lips that giveth a right answer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Prepare thy work without, and make it fit for thyself in the field; and afterwards build thy house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not a witness against thy neighbor without cause; and deceive ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with thy lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Say not, I will do so to him as he hath done to me: I will render to the man according to his work.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I went by the field of the slothful, and by the vineyard of the man void of understanding;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And lo, it was all grown over with thorns, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " nettles had covered the face of it, and its stone wall was broken down.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then I saw, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " considered ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " well: I looked upon ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " received instruction.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a little sleep, a little slumber, a little folding of the hands to sleep:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.24.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.24.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So shall thy poverty come ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one that traveleth; and thy want as an armed man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
